                <l xml:id="m-162abd15-950c-4354-9570-00ded4f6fa0f" facs="#m-9938bc80-05ce-418c-9a5b-9ff9bc3914c9" label="ambiguous">November 30.</l><l xml:id="m-9cca3152-04c8-4d20-9b37-2dc4d7d2e64c" facs="#m-b33b6943-e00d-4634-b5bf-51d4791af609" label="ambiguous">1305</l><l xml:id="m-13734b00-4413-43e1-ac2f-39271fe4e28a" facs="#m-2bd10e92-ce4c-464f-8327-f91cfdd59f4d" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-6c0c041c-bb86-4a4e-a6b1-d2a8a025e79a" facs="#m-b34561d8-9e73-4fc3-8f99-a04ebcbe39e7" label="lyrics-like">Ajestátem tuam, Dómine, sup-ctor; *ita apud te sit pro nobis</l><l xml:id="m-0e23144d-70ec-486a-a4fc-bec2ee4fcb8e" facs="#m-c9a1d26b-7434-4315-a6f2-22d7a22a5556" label="lyrics-like">91L pliciter exorámus: t ut, sicut l perpétuus intercéssor. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c56d49b3-adf0-44a8-bde5-90703ff8eb94" facs="#m-04b64988-4ff1-4d70-829b-18df128123ab" label="ambiguous">num nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-64c20059-4c9a-464d-b530-63b11e512f21" facs="#m-4757839d-6e0e-4ade-9ab1-e78e28afcadb" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésiae tuae beátus Andréas Apó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b6edecfa-bea9-445b-a71e-f2c8227382c1" facs="#m-18fc8303-33d8-4be0-8004-9d5e8fe04e29" label="lyrics-like">stolus éxstitit praedicátor et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3aac26d-8636-4485-ab7d-cc43f0d77be7" facs="#m-95acb75d-5af5-4699-b26d-95e9013c081d" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. Rom. 1o. b.</l><l xml:id="m-ecaac2c4-fab1-4bb6-b3b8-b70c40ccb35e" facs="#m-104d8c80-58e8-4f6b-9964-d1b6aa01bc20" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Corde enim créditur !Quómodo vero praedicábunt, nisi</l><l xml:id="m-87adf2ca-450a-43ee-b466-cad9a6a96e98" facs="#m-20eef512-86c5-4e95-93a6-61d85ae2b0a5" label="lyrics-like">ad justítiam: ore autem con¬</l><l xml:id="m-144da38c-9a1c-475c-9d9b-ea57d40cd337" facs="#m-9295951b-cc51-400c-867a-e13a71e5a0cf" label="lyrics-like">mittántur? sicut scriptum est:</l><l xml:id="m-a4e22fb7-2331-4ce7-95f7-8aa953031862" facs="#m-0daca7df-9495-41a8-a89e-724fcb542478" label="lyrics-like">féssio fit ad salútem. Dicit enim</l><l xml:id="m-bf2d7f85-3d7f-425e-9b7c-dd3b26bcb17c" facs="#m-debf0be4-941e-4a49-8208-eee7e22ab5fc" label="lyrics-like">Quam speciósi pedes evangelizán¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ce4f7a8-2d44-429e-b8d2-e8cbd32312ac" facs="#m-f770a752-0b5c-49cb-827a-6f0e86d61255" label="lyrics-like">Scriptúra: Omnis qui credit in</l><l xml:id="m-a07d11e1-0d04-423e-9beb-a11202fc33d0" facs="#m-b5129875-f88c-4835-a367-3855330b0a1c" label="lyrics-like">tium pacem, evangelizántium bo¬</l><l xml:id="m-c578d470-f464-4f22-8132-52f35e9cd8a2" facs="#m-d006dc9b-4874-4162-8e32-292a70597920" label="lyrics-like">illum, non confundétur. Non enim</l><l xml:id="m-07162af1-aba9-4055-a874-1d31e79c46ae" facs="#m-82f3c73b-e7eb-4aae-bb24-d721e1a2b793" label="lyrics-like">na! Sed non omnes obédiunt Evan¬</l><l xml:id="m-31f9176a-acab-440e-ae5f-ed4b16c4d854" facs="#m-a9058a95-9d1c-4d99-81e7-bb7dea4fca3e" label="lyrics-like">gélio. Isaias enim dicit: Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b172290b-a85a-4261-9416-4dc890904f79" facs="#m-41813705-214f-47c2-80ef-77daf1e198ef" label="lyrics-like">est distinctio Judaéi et Graeci: nam</l><l xml:id="m-f7826ef7-da40-48c9-a186-6d6d471b7dc9" facs="#m-6b08cd0c-ff8d-4028-b526-7e90012e9e43" label="lyrics-like">ne, quis crédidit auditui nostro?</l><l xml:id="m-82695346-97b5-4da2-8fe7-37ce810175c9" facs="#m-34807010-d882-462e-82da-6d35598aa635" label="lyrics-like">idem Dóminus ómnium, dives in</l><l xml:id="m-2bd8e6b4-a6bd-42f5-8e0f-715a858330c3" facs="#m-ec5d1157-79b4-4a30-a31a-957bc0769eeb" label="ambiguous">omnes qui invocant illum. Omnis</l><l xml:id="m-86b2ad81-445b-473e-82e7-6f2f726aee67" facs="#m-7baa51da-ea6a-4610-9d7e-f44128c659ae" label="ambiguous">Ergo fides ex auditu, auditus autem</l><l xml:id="m-3c7dae4a-ce96-453e-aa7d-a9ead6f475b7" facs="#m-94db4688-eafd-4a4e-85f0-fde698fc25da" label="ambiguous">per verbum Christi. Sed dico:</l><l xml:id="m-f6639db8-2a27-4a8c-84a0-717f5a230bbc" facs="#m-a7871987-cfb2-436a-836f-48b149aeee4c" label="lyrics-like">enim quicúmque invocáverit nomen</l><l xml:id="m-567fcecf-bbca-4515-90a2-b33be96f01eb" facs="#m-0bf47bce-2830-4171-a062-d11bdeff6c9b" label="lyrics-like">Dómini, salvus erit. Quómodo ergo</l><l xml:id="m-02d63e23-de72-427a-b5a7-97702d1ff891" facs="#m-3c0ff335-0c60-488c-9b4c-5053b00bca79" label="lyrics-like">Numquid non audiérunt? Et qui¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf7e4c42-815b-43a3-8e70-aefa7b50f222" facs="#m-3bdd96ba-ec35-4788-b52a-63549048a7cb" label="lyrics-like">invocábunt, in quem non credidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e1521cf-d85b-4cdb-91f5-e7131ab8c309" facs="#m-6b5e462f-6362-4b5f-ab54-37e4dec0bbb6" label="ambiguous">dem in omnem terram exivit sonus</l><l xml:id="m-859f00ab-b623-468b-b929-908ae6139204" facs="#m-170b00b3-61a0-408e-9abc-b5577402ea33" label="lyrics-like">runt? Aut quómodo credent ei,</l><l xml:id="m-c229987a-004c-4e17-bee0-a43812ddc300" facs="#m-6ad2708e-c4e9-4bd5-bf8a-eba5c65e9da8" label="lyrics-like">eórum, et in fines orbis terrae</l><l xml:id="m-12bea4fe-7c6d-41c0-ba4e-058abb9da414" facs="#m-036cdef8-db0a-47ba-9d6d-1620845ec050" label="lyrics-like">quem non audiérunt? Quómodo</l><l xml:id="m-d0f4fe68-0e27-4e49-82aa-0d7c8bfae7be" facs="#m-2745fd35-dc2d-41eb-8699-29cdcebd731f" label="lyrics-like">verba eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-57502b4f-dd7d-4843-ae37-81945b800d9a" facs="#m-209a75f3-04a2-4f06-844b-602294a0b4cd" label="lyrics-like">autem áudient sine praedicante?</l><l xml:id="m-a6702422-2965-4ac8-bf77-fbedf489c3fb" facs="#m-ed0a5526-feed-422f-8d43-20b984f9533b" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Constitues éos. p. 1519.</l><l xml:id="m-70e2885f-9815-4b5f-9f14-8f91a4127d0f" facs="#m-bec08862-a854-408f-bf4f-f97f548f5c66" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-935248c5-23bc-4d76-b85f-bfa39569140b" facs="#m-4db125da-fdf3-4f9a-90a1-a17e23bb32a3" label="lyrics-like">H Lle¬ ĺ¬ia"i</l><l xml:id="m-89f904dc-f9ad-4b9a-bff4-50b9bf3dfb1d" facs="#m-e0821e3c-6bc9-4da1-ab0d-1a57a0880862" label="lyrics-like">V. Di-lé-xit</l><l xml:id="m-fa3b1867-4514-4d48-9a98-2398513d1d68" facs="#m-77985f17-7528-4dff-b88c-0364fb0d65d1" label="lyrics-like">André¬ am</l><l xml:id="m-abda0181-99d4-46e7-93d6-5f63156499bc" facs="#m-1d80315a-1a7e-46d7-aa30-523c4f935944" label="lyrics-like">in o-dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3fc1ed86-ab05-4d01-9cee-89264cf88859" facs="#m-bfbb5a92-d2fd-4100-9b20-bb70042a2de7" label="lyrics-like">Dó-mi- nus</l><l xml:id="m-5e706462-6a22-42db-a276-95434b629891" facs="#m-fb5c06f6-ba65-4cab-9964-8762e21c2f05" label="lyrics-like">rem “ su-a- vi¬ tá¬</l><l xml:id="m-939fd8f3-6c5a-475c-adc2-a7f7771dec46" facs="#m-fd669f53-8f22-4b13-9469-3bdc734c54d5" label="ambiguous">tis.</l><l xml:id="m-e0042dc6-0ccf-44e8-bfb9-f5d2a89df5a8" facs="#m-73368a16-ce0e-4fc5-8693-2b9bd2dd3504" label="ambiguous">N° s01.— 48</l></lg>
